\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Data collection device.} The Raspberry Pi (bottom) reads, processes, and stores data from the IMU (top right). The sEMG sensor (bottom right) was not used due to hardware issues. During data collection, the Pi was powered by a portable battery pack. A box was used to protect the Raspberry Pi from damage, and the IMU was taped to participants' wrists.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
